ry 13, 2026\\n38,200 IQ – January 20, 2026\\n39,300 IQ – January 29, 2026\\n\\nThank you so much! I’ve been reinstated, guys!!! – April 27, 2026\\n\\n43,300 IQ – April 28, 2026\\n51,755 IQ – June 24, 2026\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nPre 25K IQ graph (in 2025)\",\"api_path\":\"/users/22696076\",\"avatar\":{\"tiny\":{\"url\":\"https://images.genius.com/avatars/tiny/b6dc8fdf32d3c76625d3e8432cebc7a6\",\"bounding_box\":{\"width\":16,\"height\":16}},\"thumb\":{\"url\":\"https://images.genius.com/avatars/thumb/b6dc8fdf32d3c76625d3e8432cebc7a6\",\"bounding_box\":{\"width\":32,\"height\":32}},\"small\":{\"url\":\"https://images.genius.com/avatars/small/b6dc8fdf32d3c76625d3e8432cebc7a6\",\"bounding_box\":{\"width\":100,\"height\":100}},\"medium\":{\"url\":\"https://images.genius.com/avatars/medium/b6dc8fdf32d3c76625d3e8432cebc7a6\",\"bounding_box\":{\"width\":300,\"height\":400}}},\"header_image_url\":\"https://assets.genius.com/images/default_banner.png?1787167748\",\"human_readable_role_for_display\":\"Transcriber\",\"id\":22696076,\"iq\":101464,\"is_meme_verified\":false,\"is_verified\":false,\"login\":\"infinitehoax\",\"name\":\"infinitehoax\",\"role_for_display\":\"transcriber\",\"url\":\"https://genius.com/infinitehoax\",\"current_user_metadata\":{\"permissions\":[],\"excluded_permissions\":[\"follow\"],\"interactions\":{\"following\":false}}},\"rejection_comment\":null,\"top_comment\":null,\"verified_by\":null}]},\"featured_artists\":[],\"lyrics_marked_complete_by\":{\"_type\":\"user\",\"about_me_summary\":\"HE’S BACKKKKKKK\\n\\n✦ achievements here ✦\\n\\naspiring editor\\nbest works I’m proud of:\\ntates: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5\\nartist bios: 1, 2, 3\\nsong bio: 1\\nalbum bio: 1\\n⁕\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nI’m on a mission; don’t distract me.\\nOne RRR, one day! You can join too, here. (so much for staying consistent)\\n\\n3,000 IQ – May 24, 2025\\n4,000 IQ – August 1, 2025\\n5,000 IQ – August 29, 2025 (1000 IQ in one month is crazy! – for me)\\n6,000 IQ – September 7, 2025 (I’m on crack)\\n\\n